{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 51, :comments ["<b>And it came to pass on the very day.</b> In my opinion this verse is joined with the verse that follows it, for HaShem spoke to Moses to consecrate the firstborn, and at midnight was the plague of the firstborn, and when Israel went out by day, HaShem immediately commanded to consecrate the firstborn of Israel and the firstborn of their cattle."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:33:59.914311789Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}